            "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:44:05.498155+00:00",
            "notes": "At this stage, making sure we stay alive is very important, so [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is great at improving that without compromising on damage.\n\nWe take  [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) since it's a great, easy way to apply the burn to an enemy to benefit from the 20% increased damage.\n\nTaking  [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) is also a great option here as it's better at applying burn to multiple allies at once.\n\n - [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) - Better at focusing single targets\n - [Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b) - Better at threatening multiple targets",
